Step 3: Creating a "Synched" Post
When you create a new post for a track like "Routine":
In the post editor, click Links in the sidebar.
Paste the direct .mp3 URL into the Enclosure Links field.
Add the Shadow Layer XML from the previous step into the post's HTML view.
Publish. Podbean will see the new enclosure link in your Blogger feed and create the episode automatically. 
